# Code owners for the files that can change who may merge, what a merge or a
# deploy checks, or who can reach a secret. The owner approves those. Every
# other file is unowned, so a pull request touching only those merges on the
# reviewer App's approval. There is deliberately no catch-all line.
#
# GitHub applies the LAST matching line, so a line with no owner releases a
# path an earlier line owned. The released files sit after the owned groups and
# before the five shared lines. Those five come from the standards template and
# stay last, byte for byte, so the standards sync check passes.
#
# Matching is case-sensitive and has no character classes, so each name form
# below is spelled in lower-case, Capitalised and UPPER-case.

# Workflows and actions: they run with the repository's secrets and decide
# pass or fail on every pull request.
**/.github/workflows/                          @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/.github/actions/                            @branchLeft/branchleft-admin

# CODEOWNERS and ruleset or branch-protection files: they say who must approve.
**/CODEOWNERS                                  @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/codeowners                                  @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/CodeOwners                                  @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*ruleset*                                   @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*Ruleset*                                   @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*RULESET*                                   @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*branch-protection*                         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*Branch-Protection*                         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*BRANCH-PROTECTION*                         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*branch_protection*                         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*Branch_Protection*                         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*BRANCH_PROTECTION*                         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*branchprotection*                          @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*BranchProtection*                          @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*BRANCHPROTECTION*                          @branchLeft/branchleft-admin

# The gate code and its tests: the lint and merged-status tools every repo's CI
# calls, the apply-gate tests, the hook registry that runs them, and the
# ignore files that switch checks off.
/tools/                                        @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.pre-commit-hooks.yaml                        @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.opv-lint*                                    @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/tools/floors.tsv                              @branchLeft/branchleft-admin

# Keys, trust and access. Nothing here exists in this repo today; the lines
# keep these files the owner's if they ever appear.
**/allowed_signers                             @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/ansible/trust/                                @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/.npmrc                                      @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/Pulumi.*.yaml                               @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/library/                                    @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*_plugins/                                  @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/module_utils/                               @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*sudoers*                                   @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*sudoers*/                                  @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/authorized_keys*                            @branchLeft/branchleft-admin

# Mail. Nothing here exists in this repo today.
/mail/                                         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin

# The owner's own words: the licence text.
/LICENSE                                       @branchLeft/branchleft-admin

# Released: prose that explains a kept gate and that no job reads as input.
# These lines name no owner and must stay after every owned line above.
/tools/docs-lint-rules.md
/tools/opv-lint-rules.md
/tools/resolve-pinned-ref.md

# The shared set from the standards template. Keep these lines last.
/.standardsignore        @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.standards.mode         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.docs-lint*             @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.standards-db-tooling   @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.github/                @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
